### J6.2 — Dependency Injection basics: request collection
### VS Code (REST Client / Humao extension), JetBrains Rider and Visual Studio 2022+ run this file directly.
### Start the app first (from the WebApp folder):  dotnet run -- J6.2
### Requests are separated by ###; run them with "Send Request" / the green arrow.

@host = http://localhost:5080

### 0) Index
GET {{host}}/

### 1) Lifetimes: send this several times — Transient changes on every resolve, Scoped once per request, Singleton never
GET {{host}}/lifetimes

### 2) Several IGreeter registrations: IEnumerable<IGreeter> (all, in order) vs IGreeter (the last one wins) + TryAdd* log
GET {{host}}/greeters?name=Ada

### 3) Captive dependency (singleton -> scoped): validation ON throws, validation OFF stays silent, IServiceScopeFactory fixes it
GET {{host}}/captive
